/*!

*\page send_script Send_script
*
* This instruction is used to send via RS232/Terminal script program.
* You need to stop the process by sending the symbol '#'.
* After that the text (script) will be saved as default script program on
* the SD card.
*
*<span style='color:blue'><em><H4> Syntax: </H4></em></span>
*   <strong>send_script  script_Text#  </strong>
*
* <span style='color:green'><strong>Note:</strong></span><br>
* An SD-card module must be connected to the Nucleo board through SPI, with an SD card inserted. The card must be mounted before using this instruction.
*/
